A '''Box of Junk''' is a {{Rare}} consumable.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Box of Junk''' is a {{Yellow|'''MINOR'''}} reward from the Year 500 [[Raffle of the Century]].

'''Box of Junk''' can also be chosen as a reward from {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.
== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Box of Junk''' grants any combination of {{Green|5}} of the following items:
